  "figures": [
    {
      "file": "01_features_and_cohorts.png",
      "title": "\u041f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u043a\u0438, \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0442\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u043e\u0431\u0449\u0430\u044f \u0432\u044b\u0431\u043e\u0440\u043a\u0430",
      "caption": "Availability is causal and shared by every family. Presence of a feature is not evidence that the model uses it. Unknown future outcomes remain on the clock.",
      "sha256": "a2836005a755c6338815928767e159e2de51fab11171820a986c4f7d19928e1d"
    },
    {
      "file": "02_learning_by_family.png",
      "title": "\u041e\u0431\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u0441\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u043c\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u0438 \u0430\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0443\u0440\u044b",
      "caption": "TRAIN curves use the same fixed probe, not every training root. A selected update 0 is explicitly an untrained network, not successful learning.",
      "sha256": "9f1f668f8dda7d3572a22db1646b90ebcd115e10db0fc8738e0f388c7cf48ba7"
    },
    {
      "file": "03_selection_and_test.png",
      "title": "\u0412\u044b\u0431\u043e\u0440 \u043f\u043e validation \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0430 \u043d\u0430 test",
      "caption": "The seed replication is not a second test-selected winner. Bin labels are root counts; correlated roots do not supply independent confidence intervals.",
      "sha256": "5e7105e6a40d10e296238f7e50bebeb6e398c861b2d818d751a5eacddc6cf37b"
    },
    {
      "file": "03a_test_open_may11.png",
      "title": "\u0424\u0438\u043a\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0443\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043a 2026-05-11, London +0 \u0447",
      "caption": "Gray marks unknown outcomes. Forecasts use only admitted X. No target smoothing, profitable-case search or account-equity interpretation is applied.",
      "sha256": "49476f6dbd226358bf385f35f35439fad702b7373d143302f06d94b9972e6d49"
    },
    {
      "file": "03b_test_afternoon_may18.png",
      "title": "\u0424\u0438\u043a\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0443\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043a 2026-05-18, London +5 \u0447",
      "caption": "Gray marks unknown outcomes. Forecasts use only admitted X. No target smoothing, profitable-case search or account-equity interpretation is applied.",
      "sha256": "eabf3cd6caeeb2a04af25203271b3a49f4ec818420684da3dd79c49d229cd4dc"
    },
    {
      "file": "04_temporal_vs_loss_gradients.png",
      "title": "\u0418\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u0438 \u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\u0438\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b loss",
      "caption": "Indicator TV is computed without ordinal class distances. Low probability TV is not evidence of predictive skill; assess NLL, calibration and execution separately.",
      "sha256": "00714a63d23b8eb221f1ae90a24b2e968393e3d360d651956dd78139dea09df1"
    },
    {
      "file": "05_gradient_mass_and_alignment.png",
      "title": "\u041c\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0430 \u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\u0438\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u0438 \u0432\u0437\u0430\u0438\u043c\u043e\u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435 \u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432",
      "caption": "Per-root logit derivatives are unreduced. Difficulty bins use joint p(true class): hard <0.4, intermediate 0.4-0.8, easy >=0.8. For positive events the joint probability includes pE, so hard bins are not independent evidence of difficult direction classification. Encoder gradients use the shared known-root mean; negative cosine alone does not establish that separate networks improve results.",
      "sha256": "aa03609c8178361c00f8b4e692d1f2aba372eb369348c63e125732d7785a7257"
    },
    {
      "file": "06_risk_and_execution.png",
      "title": "\u0420\u0438\u0441\u043a, \u0438\u0437\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u043a\u0438 \u0438 \u043e\u0442\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435",
      "caption": "Top panels condition on future-observed outcomes and are oracle diagnostics, not a strategy. Bottom uses CAL-selected one-position policy; CENSORED halts replay.",
      "sha256": "5710e2fe180af4fa5c51dfd8a0ee0adf477ee9d50b0d1dd661376f45efb69c2e"
    },
    {
      "file": "07_context_history.png",
      "title": "\u0424\u0430\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u044f",
      "caption": "61 tokens allow AT MOST 300 s. Current-token rolling statistics can summarize older history; rich-only London/FFT features are absent from the selected micro model.",
      "sha256": "859506b52c400b38197d66ce8da381a842891719eae0cb1c6d2f8fa92f6d3d47"
    },
    {
      "file": "crossing_case.png",
      "title": "\u041e\u0434\u043d\u0430 \u0444\u0438\u043a\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043a\u0430: \u0434\u0435\u0432\u044f\u0442\u044c \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u044b\u0445 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0438 \u043e\u0442\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f",
      "caption": "Anchor is May 11 first origin +1 hour. Late hollow crossings do not enter the 300-second label. MAE/MFE ranges are saved excursions, not invented equity paths.",
      "sha256": "879af343658ecac940104041b888b83dfbd6cb79a36a4afc5126706cb0cbc718"
    }
